{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Gm]I will bless the Lord [Eb]at all [F]times
[Bb]His praise shall always be in [Eb]my mouth
My [Gm]soul shall boast in the [Eb]Lord
[Bb]Let the humble hear [Eb]and be glad
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Gm]Oh, magnify [F]the Lord with me
[Bb]Let us exalt [Eb]his name together
[Gm]Oh, magni[F]fy the Lord with [Bb]me
Let us exalt [Eb]his name
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Gm]I sought the Lord and he [Eb]answered [F]me
[Bb]He delivered me from all [Eb]my fears
[Gm]Those who look [F]to him are ra[Eb]diant
[Bb]Their faces shall ne[Eb]ver be ashamed
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Gm]Oh, magnify [F]the Lord with me
